    "text": "Akan tiba masa Anda mengalami satu situasi sampai Anda mengatakan, \"Kapan berakhirnya yang seperti ini?\"",
    "keyword": "storm",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g9754657cb1b2cbdb64b4845fcf3c246dc546cb2b3dafa92545b513072902c10ef8f1a25aee5acf142fad6381eae0cd67ef7fab6157b709ce9074a467de815740_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.5,
    "end": 7.5,
    "text": "Serang, serang, serang.",
    "keyword": "thunderstorm",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g9794d4af477f1462d90b5d31538029d3a08b1789700332398a9547ec77c97f2cd665f8027750a81252987092541b1319a4480870717b4a7465c5aaecfb846b6e_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.5,
    "end": 16.5,
    "text": "Perhatikan, jika Anda berada pada level ini, saya ucapkan selamat kepada Anda karena Anda akan diangkat pada kedudukan yang tertinggi di antara sekian ujian yang ada: Zulzilu.",
    "keyword": "mountain",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g7ab945242d855491c2caafea4df82617f1f771d6b4e7377b974fc93dad53dee3e20719e2e81b6edb7ec3a5ebe41db6d14402bf6847e6843a85c9b4987c304686_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.8,
    "end": 21,
    "text": "Artinya Allah akan naikkan Anda pada derajat yang tinggi.",
    "keyword": "summit",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g6aa73fb8f60358a40ea8513195586cc06ee2678fb0530a88434171f8a1d511f2937f31afff90a96cbee1af57c1f85bc7e1fe0b308418d74780315027775d7134_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.5,
    "end": 28.3,
    "text": "Karena hukum ujian tadi, la yukallifullahu nafsan illa wus'aha, Allah enggak akan menguji seorang hamba di luar batas kemampuannya.",
    "keyword": "desert",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g4943383fa365d0850ec5f5da9ff0d9ef8e6b8678170c3aeb2f1a154afb1989914c5128160657cd0bff631093a8d141b0e26390e5ac8458c9b5abd9a16a124d90_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.3,
    "end": 33,
    "text": "Jikalau Anda sudah dipandang oleh Allah siap menerima yang ini, maka Anda akan diberikan zulzilu.",
    "keyword": "cliff",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g02acdf47d28c532d10044afe3da281830a7868439c69cab865963b60dc5fa406c73eb6a9b7bb4edb3ba04a660653ae89c5adf70846861c9752c4865e86ae2c9a_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 33,
    "end": 36.5,
    "text": "Kalau Anda enggak mampu, Anda hanya akan diberikan dharra' atau ba'sa'.",
    "keyword": "rain",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/ga64c11b7319611de62b0975fb831a3a8d985bc2fcbd75d01a474350bfbb88d4c500e17401ca52cd195d4163607da1041f66618997b8823cd043eafdb8106b4f0_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.5,
    "end": 44.5,
    "text": "Anda merasa sedang punya masalah yang berat, membuat hati Anda goyah, saya ucapkan pada Anda, dari sekian hamba Allah yang ada di muka bumi cuman Anda yang diberikan itu.",
    "keyword": "ocean",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g57f48e9e3f5bd5a63c7651e3993b5ab3da8e1e4bb4132d348dccb88136e956e7bc78a293834f7c4675880f53740204b70fec0015cb308659b3f85a2904cd0306_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.5,
    "end": 47.5,
    "text": "Artinya Allah akan mengangkat derajat Anda.",
    "keyword": "sunrise",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g82762ab0c5350ee4931a3d89cf06bafd5248f7ea8ca817064f2c089e07959917d86b781e78a942fa7ab285d810a721d6ce199ed58faf2f728738ae961a24a9b1_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 48,
    "end": 49.3,
    "text": "Ayo bahagia!",
    "keyword": "meadow",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g2b7ae560a8378071e351461a3b7094bb8f488d02d89e28864812d9768472c4d8e34a12cf96a4966b55bf0203e28b1b34dc758c16ba44f14081586e1b13e97e79_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 49.3,
    "end": 53,
    "text": "Dan yakinlah bukan orang lain yang dititipkan, Anda yang diberikan.",
    "keyword": "forest",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/gadc8eb5a55e0f57d9a9da4fa13f25b351112e5473a31a2c0b82d68fa8b66fee68ee11c1e5d383f884abdc2de27e5b85d9fb6a7b9cd777628ffdb7b76c260be5a_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 53,
    "end": 56.5,
    "text": "Allah percaya pada Anda, kenapa Anda tidak yakin?",
    "keyword": "lake",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g895c0d7f25436a96d00c488cfb1052e28d96607e2e2fe3b925fdbd5ffea4c0cde1144abf5a7458b473f0a0d094018559515497c53b1183512509b01631456c6f_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 56.5,
    "end": 57.8,
    "text": "Bukan orang lain.",
    "keyword": "stream",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g20419f652153cf4e5018eeb0e99b074ea9c294f8960383e634077b2f633c9b4e757d51b0c574af6ff09360570e7949cb1b6f6997f9612ae3512cb0796fc0cd1e_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.8,
    "end": 63.3,
    "text": "Jadi mustahil Allah memberikan ujian berat kalau Anda enggak sanggup, karena cuman Anda yang sanggup, Anda yang dikasih.",
    "keyword": "waterfall",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/g682745a45017e979d55b1f1bf315c82738ac7eb4626ca32d3c339eba84d1d8968012f0381e2d2f5fab20959d0c557a38d92169e53caa649fe28c3c4c36d240fa_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 63.3,
    "end": 64.8,
    "text": "Makanya jangan mengeluh.",
    "keyword": "breeze",
    "image": "https://pixabay.com/get/gdc5d0bba0d4ee643b52f170a4b53c6b613f9f3f69a7eacd00d06de08ba7ccfc7ccc7ddef53610be56d65ef9d98518191412c91ee1973cdb6e8233f45fc23e607_1280.jpg"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.8,
    "end": 67.8,
    "text": "Jangan katakan, \"Ya Allah, kenapa saya ya Allah? Why me?\"",
    "keyword": "fog",
